      "The spirit of discovery begins at Lost River Cave, where the annual Scarecrow Trail transforms woodland paths into an open-air gallery of handcrafted creations tucked beneath a colorful canopy. As daylight fades, Lost Tales of the Underground offers a different perspective of the valley, blending regional folklore, theatrical performance, and the quiet mystery of Kentucky's cave country into a hauntingly unique experience.",
