    paragraphs: [
      "Cold beer, hot pizza, and good company. When it comes to great food and local flavor, Menomonie, Wisconsin, knows how to deliver. Whether you're planning a weekend getaway, exploring Wisconsin's craft beer scene, or searching for your next favorite pizza, Menomonie serves up plenty of reasons to visit. Let's Talk BeerMenomonie's craft beer scene is packed with personality. At Lucette Brewing Company, great beer and wood fired pizza go hand in hand.",
      "Known for its creative pizza combinations and handcrafted brews, Lucette is a must for foodies and beer enthusiasts alike. From perfectly crisp crusts to fresh, flavorful toppings, the pizzas are worth the trip. Pair your favorite with a locally brewed beer and you've got the makings of a great afternoon. Looking for a little history with your hops? Head downtown to brewery nønic, located in a beautifully restored historic train depot. This welcoming brewery combines creative craft beers with plenty of character.",
      "The historic setting, relaxed atmosphere, and rotating beer selections make it a great place to sample local flavors. For another taste of Menomonie's creative side, check out Zymurgy Brewing Company. Located in a former auto shop, Zymurgy offers inventive craft beers in a casual, friendly setting. With a variety of styles to explore, it's a fun stop for seasoned beer lovers and curious newcomers alike. Not sure what to order? There's something about finding a great local pizza place while traveling.",
      "Ted's Pizza Palace has been serving the community for generations. Known for its Greek style pizza, generous toppings, and welcoming atmosphere, Ted's is a Menomonie tradition. For a casual evening, Cubby's offers pizza, cold drinks, and a friendly neighborhood atmosphere. Stroll through historic downtown and discover locally owned shops, inviting gathering places, and colorful murals celebrating the community's history. Come for the pizza. Stay for the beer. Discover everything in between.",
    ],
